Lately I've been looking at upgrading the Node version for our application. Everything seems fine except some tests which would consistently fail after upgrade. Through some debugging and binary search in Node versions, I was able to exclude unrelated libraries and trim down the issue to a reproducible example. 

The main issue seems to be that when I want to verify that posting FormData and mock an expected response,  Axios no longer receives this response. I must admit that I don't know if this is an Axios issue, a bug in Node or some combination. But at least it is consistent, so hopefully someone can take a look and find out what is happening underneath the hood. :)

