Built-in support for:
- Token-based auth injection (requireAuth)
- Automatic status code handling (200/201/204)
- Optional request/response logging
- Centralized error formatting
- Special handling for DELETE with body
- Fully customizable via config
- Tree-shakable (not part of core instance unless imported)

